          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "测井曲线分层业务问题",
          "html": "<p>一口井常规三四条曲线、上千米井段，解释员要对照邻井逐段卡层，单井 2—4 小时；薄互层段界线模糊，不同人卡层位置可差 0.5—1 m，直接影响射孔与压裂分段。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"自然伽马与层段响应\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" fill=\"#274746\"><path d=\"M112 258H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">43.0</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"112\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.0</text><path d=\"M112 205.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"210.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">65.5</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"251.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">59.8</text><path d=\"M112 153H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">87.9</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"391\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">119.5</text><path d=\"M112 100.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"105.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">110.4</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"530.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">179.3</text><path d=\"M112 48H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">132.8</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"670\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">239.0</text><path d=\"M112.00 239.74 L114.33 241.88 L116.67 233.64 L119.00 228.88 L121.34 239.00 L123.67 237.37 L126.01 229.36 L128.34 239.54 L130.68 234.80 L133.01 238.92 L135.35 236.27 L137.68 243.49 L140.02 241.49 L142.35 241.01 L144.69 258.00 L147.02 244.84 L149.36 244.76 L151.69 246.36 L154.03 245.71 L156.36 240.11 L158.69 240.94 L161.03 241.84 L163.36 235.51 L165.70 238.84 L168.03 249.41 L170.37 246.19 L172.70 236.60 L175.04 236.65 L177.37 228.37 L179.71 230.32 L182.04 240.81 L184.38 236.36 L186.71 